## Contract Details

### TokenFactory Features
- No-code ERC-20 token deployment
- USD-based fees converted via Chainlink price feeds
- Pausable by owner
- Configurable fee settings
- Comprehensive input validation

### BasicERC20 Features
- Standard ERC-20 implementation
- Configurable decimals (0-30)
- Initial supply minted to specified owner
- No additional minting capability (immutable supply)

